AVX-512 kernels load 64-byte constants. Keep each constant in a single
SHF_MERGE entry so linkers cannot deduplicate its 32-byte halves independently.

diff --git a/kernel/avx512/kernel_dgemm_16x8_lib8.S b/kernel/avx512/kernel_dgemm_16x8_lib8.S
